This directory is a vendored snapshot, not a submodule. The upstream
project has its own pyproject.toml; we keep the source in-tree so the
DreamReader toolkit can pin it precisely against our torch / diffusers
matrix and patch the SAE loaders for our hook sites without forcing
contributors to maintain a separate fork.

Original README and CHANGELOG are preserved at ./README.md and
./CHANGELOG.md respectively. Any local changes belong in those files'
diffs against the snapshotted upstream commit.
